# Fail closed: only the installable runtime package inputs enter the primary
# build context. The verified model is supplied as a separate named context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!requirements-container.txt
!src/
!src/security_anomaly/
!src/security_anomaly/**

# Consequently excluded: .git, local venvs, caches, build/dist, *.egg-info,
# data/raw, data/processed, models/*, tests, tools, research/evaluation scripts,
# score dumps, IDE files, and temporary release bundles.
